<title>USA: Lucent &amp; Gen DataCom win Dutch deal.</title>
<headline>Lucent &amp; Gen DataCom win Dutch deal.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLEBURY, Conn. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc and General DataCom Industries Inc said Tuesday they will sell asynchronous transfer mode technology to the Dutch Koninklijke PTT Nederland.</p>
<p>&quot;We're supplying 85 switches at $50,000 each and Lucent is the integrator,&quot; a General DataCom spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The technology will enable the Dutch telecommunications company to deliver high-speed internet access to subscribers, General DataCom said.</p>
</text>
